~ start

Guide: Hi, nice to meet you.
Guide: Welcome to your new farm.
Guide: As you can see, the cows and chickens are hungry.
Guide: We need to grow some crops before we can feed them again.
Guide: But first, you'll need some Corn Seeds.
Guide: The Seed Shop nearby still has some in stock.

- Take 125 Gold
    Player: Thank you! I'll buy some Corn Seeds.
    do PlayerProgressManager.add_gold(125)
    do SeedUnlockManager.unlock_seed("corn_seeds")
    do QuestManager.start_quest("buy_corn_seeds")

- Maybe later
    Player: I'll come back when I'm ready.

=> END


~ progress

Guide: The Seed Shop is nearby.
Guide: Buy 5 Corn Seeds and come back to me.

=> END


~ turn_in

Guide: Excellent!
Guide: You bought everything you need.

do QuestManager.try_complete_quest()

Guide: Before you begin farming, let me show you the tools you'll be using.

Guide: Use the Hoe to till the soil.

Guide: Plant your Corn Seeds on the tilled land.

Guide: Water your crops every day with the Watering Can.

Guide: If weeds start growing, clear them with the Scythe.

Guide: Here, these tools are yours now.

do GameDialogueManager.action_teach_farming()

Guide: Now it's your turn.

do QuestManager.start_quest("first_harvest")

Guide: Harvest 5 Corn and come back to show me what you've learned.

=> END


~ completed

Guide: Good work, farmer.

=> END